  "description": "<blockquote data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1394\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"93\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Omega x Swatch MoonSwatch – ‘Mission to Pluto’ (SO33M101) – S‑Grade, compleet met doos!”</strong></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1442\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Deze <strong data-start=\"5\" data-end=\"27\">‘Mission to Pluto’</strong> MoonSwatch is in <strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"65\">S‑Grade conditie</strong> — praktisch ongedragen, minimal zichtbare sporen. Je ontvangt het horloge <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"194\">compleet met originele doos, kussentje en papieren</strong> — ready to impress.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1476\"><strong data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1474\">Opvallende kenmerken:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1522\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Bioceramic kast in koel grijs met bordeaux bezel en Velcro®-bandje in donkergrijs.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1609\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Chronograaffuncties met elegante wijzers en het iconische branding van OMEGA × Swatch, inclusief ‘hidden S’ in het kristal en Super‑LumiNova® indexen</span> </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1697\">Een stijlvolle en lichte 42 mm MoonSwatch die speels, maar verfijnd draagbaar is.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1754\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1754\">Full set, in showroomstaat, net terug van de kast.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1807\"><strong data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1789\">Inclusief 1 maand garantie</strong> voor gemoedsrust.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</blockquote>",
